The shopkeeper is "smart" enough not to walk into a pit.  If you have enough
poisoned arrows (of course wands of lightning and fire and cold, etc. are fun
too), you'll get 'im.  Sometime I want to gather a bunch of rocks and see
how many it takes :-)  And you won't get Kops on your kase by killing
the shopkeeper, either.

